WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.070
Hello!

00:00:01.172 --> 00:00:04.192
On your calendar, bookings made online by customers,

00:00:04.142 --> 00:00:07.390
and bookings added by the salon, have different colours,

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.310
so you can tell them apart at a glance.

00:00:09.643 --> 00:00:11.950
You can choose the colour for each kind yourself.

00:00:12.606 --> 00:00:17.226
Open Settings, scroll down to Look and colours, and find the card Booking colours.

00:00:17.575 --> 00:00:21.466
On the row Booked online by customers, tap one of the ready-made colours.

00:00:21.745 --> 00:00:25.706
For something completely different, tap Background and Text to mix your own.

00:00:26.309 --> 00:00:28.599
Do the same on the row Added by the salon.

00:00:28.832 --> 00:00:32.119
The Preview below shows you straight away what both kinds look like.

00:00:32.546 --> 00:00:34.567
If you happen to pick the same colour for both,

00:00:34.517 --> 00:00:36.119
the system reminds you to change one.

00:00:36.711 --> 00:00:38.121
One more useful detail.

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:42.209
When you tap a booking, you'll see a line saying Booked online at,

00:00:42.159 --> 00:00:43.561
with the time and date.

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:48.441
For a booking the salon added, that line says Added by the salon at.

00:00:48.709 --> 00:00:51.321
So you always know exactly when a booking was created.

00:00:51.489 --> 00:00:52.761
Now take the quiz below.
